{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>and the congregation</b> — I have explained it. The sense of ועליה is that He will exalt Himself over them and show them His power. Rabbi Moses said: the congregation of nations is Israel, and the sense of ועליה למרום שובה is that He will lift them up on high. And this interpretation has no sense or savor."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:30.922515944Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}